 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Tsuki wa Hitsuji wo Kazoenai"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "月はヒツジを数えない"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Living in an unfortunate reality, schoolgirl Tachibana Himeka spends her days in despair...\nUntil one day, out of the blue, she is summoned to another world!\nAs she finally finds hope in being able to start anew, the reason she's given for being summoned is... to be the body pillow of the much too stunning imperial princess pretending to be a prince!?\n\nA story about seeking love and a good night's sleep (?) from the author of \"The Anemone Feels the Heat\", Sakuragi Ren!",
   "ja": "不幸な現実を生きている女子高生は日々絶望していた…。\nだがある日、少女は突如異世界へと召喚されることに！\n新しい人生が始まる、と希望を見出す少女に告げられた召喚理由、それは…美形すぎる男装の皇女の抱き枕になることだった！？\n『アネモネは熱を帯びる』の著者・桜木蓮が贈る恋と快眠を求める(？)物語！"
  },
